jummy0","html_url":"https://github.com/jummy0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T22:29:21Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T22:29:21Z","body":"Thank you for the clarification.  Even so, in this case I'd like Godot to _attempt_ to use OpenGL 3 as a last resort.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6242290066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6242692075","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124592#issuecomment-6242692075","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124592","id":6242692075,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdBfr6w","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-17T22:58:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T22:58:18Z","body":"> 3\\. Thank you for the clarification.  Even so, in this case I'd like Godot to _attempt_ to use OpenGL 3 as a last resort.\n\nWhat is the problem with using ANGLE in this case? This GPU will have much better odds using ANGLE than OpenGL","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6242692075/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6249048846","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124592#issuecomment-6249048846","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124592","id":6249048846,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdHjrDg","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-18T11:01:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:01:52Z","body":"To clarify, \"switching to ANGLE\" means using ANGLE as a compatibility layer for OpenGL over Direct3D. This means Godot's Compatibility renderer should work, it's just not using the known problematic native driver for it.\n\nIf you're experiencing that the Compatibility renderer doesn't work at all (e.g. it crashes after this), then it's a separate problem which would be that ANGLE doesn't work as expected on your system (which may mean that there's just no graphics API that would let you run Godot on this GPU, neither OpenGL nor Direct3D).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6249048846/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6251327290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/124592#issuecomment-6251327290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124592","id":6251327290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABdJuvOg","user":{"login":"jummy0","id":4022196,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwMjIxOTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4022196?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0","html_url":"https://github.com/jummy0","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jummy0/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-18T14:53:04Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T14:53:04Z","body":">         What is the problem with using ANGLE in this case? This GPU will have much better odds using ANGLE than OpenGL\n\nThat's a good point. I forgot ANGLE was a wrapper for OpenGL ES, so this whole post makes a lot less sense now.\n\nAnyway, I was able to fix the issue in my case (which was to play a specific game on a specific PC) by using `override.cfg` to set `rendering/driver/threads/thread_model` to Safe. The developer of the game had set it to Separate. I suppose I should've tried this earlier, given that it was suggested in the logs. My bad!\n\nFor the purposes of testing, I still think it would be a good idea to allow OpenGL 3.3 when specified as a command-line argument, even with a \"bad\" driver.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6251327290/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]